       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. WVLOAD.
      *****************************************************************
      * A FLAT BUFFER, THEN AN 01 THAT REDEFINES IT WITH A TYPED     *
      * LAYOUT OF TWO 03 GROUPS.  THE 01 LINES ARE TYPED IN COLUMN 1 *
      * so the level number lands in the card-image sequence area.   *
      * The changing field sits in the SECOND 03: it must trace up   *
      * 05 -> 03 -> 01, across the REDEFINES to WV-DATA, and WV-DATA  *
      * (4096 bytes) must be judged already big enough - a note, not  *
      * a change.                                                    *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL BEGIN DECLARE SECTION END-EXEC.
01           WV-DATA                    PIC X(4096).
01           WV-CUTBLA-VIEW REDEFINES WV-DATA.
           03  WV-CUTBLA-HDR.
               05  WV-REC-TYPE          PIC X(02).
               05  WV-REC-SEQ           PIC 9(06).
           03  WV-CUTBLA-KEY.
               05  WV-VALUE             PIC S9(10)V9(2).
               05  WV-CUST-NAME         PIC X(30).
           EXEC SQL END DECLARE SECTION END-EXEC.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT CB_VALUE, CB_NAME
                 INTO :WV-VALUE, :WV-CUST-NAME
                 FROM CUTBLA
                WHERE CB_ID = 1
           END-EXEC
           STOP RUN.
